  Str:18/** is tedious and time-consuming to get.  From 18/01 to 18/74
the benefits don't change.  The next improvement (after 18/75) is at
18/90.  Then 18/**.


  Gauntlets of Dexterity require enchanting to do much good.  That's
difficult to do in the early game.  They're generally unnecessary in the
mid to late game.  Add in the chance of finding highly enchanted gloves
in Fort Ludios or the Castle (or barracks) and using ?oEnchantArmor on
GoDex is a waste.

  +0 GoPower add +3 to hit without enchanting.  GoDex need to be at +3
to get that same benefit.



  As for the question about artifact weapons and #twoweaponing.  If
you're going to twoweapon the best secondary weapon is a silver saber.
That +10.5 average extra damage vs silver haters is just too good.




